('00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000401', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000301', '1:1 Mina / Theo — staffing the search rewrite', '## Agenda
- Search rewrite staffing
- Promo packet timing

## Notes
