', '2026-08-12', 1, '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z', '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z'),
('00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000402', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000301', '1:1 Mina / Priya — team health', 'Priya flagged Jonah''s ramp as slower than expected. Pair him with Aiko on the ingest job. No headcount this quarter.
', '2026-08-14', 1, '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z', '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z'),
('00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000403', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000303', 'Q3 planning — search + onboarding', '## Goals
1. Ship search rewrite beta to 10% of workspaces.
2. Cut new-hire time-to-first-PR to 10 days.

Harper owns the narrative. Theo owns the index. Sam will mock the empty state.
', '2026-07-22', 1, '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z', '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z'),
('00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000404', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000302', 'Theo Alvarez — Staff promo packet', '## Impact
Led the D1 query planner rewrite. Mentored Aiko through two production incidents.

## Calibration
Mina: strong yes. Omar: packet complete. Wei: approve for Sept cycle.
', '2026-06-30', 1, '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z', '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z'),
('00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000405', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000303', 'Search empty-state design review', 'Sam walked through three empty states. Theo wants the ''no index yet'' case called out separately. Lina prefers option B.
', '2026-08-05', 1, '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z', '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z'),
('00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000406', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000301', 'Jonah Reed — 30-day check-in', 'First month: onboarded, one small PR merged. Next: pair with Aiko on ingest, then take a solo bug bash.
', '2026-09-18', 1, '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z', '2026-08-20T00:00:00Z');

